30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, transport costs are huge! Almost a third of installation costs. But we can save if objects come with their own supports.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Victoria,,It's worse than I thought. The lab is down to one person with a massive backlog. We can't handle more cleaning work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shion,,Interesting. People love mechanisms and seeing someone actually working in the gallery. Static cases are boring for the visitors.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and evening hires mean we can't have fragile, open arrangements that can't be moved.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Paperwork delays have actually pushed back openings before. Also, powered displays have been breaking down during gallery hours.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if the lab is that full, we should avoid anything that needs a lot of stabilization, right?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly, Mio. Any proposal requiring heavy conservation work is a non-starter.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, does that mean we should avoid heavy sculptures in the bay?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Asuka,,Yes. And we need things that don't obstruct the room for evening events.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"And please, let's avoid complex powered displays if they just end up roped off and broken.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that makes sense. So we want something simple to install but exciting to see!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Victoria,,We also have a lot of town history volunteers. We should use their expertise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If people want to see ""work"" happening, a live demonstration or a working bench would be perfect.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Asuka,,As long as it doesn't exceed the weight limit or block the caterers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let's look for a balance of reliability and engagement.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready to see the candidates!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Shion,,Let's see if any of these fit our criteria.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will be judging them based on the structural and scheduling constraints.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope we find something that arrives on time and stays working.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
