55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Textiles (A) sounds lovely, but will the garments need a lot of mount-making? Maritime (C) might be expensive to transport.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"City Under Excavation (D) has a working bench, which Shion likes, but it might overwhelm the conservation lab.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shion,,"I love the idea of the working bench in (D) or the demonstrations in (A). Light and Motion (B) fits the ""mechanism"" trend.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Asuka,,(B) uses overhead rigging in the suspended bay. We must check the weight. (C) has cargo objects—potentially too heavy.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shizue,,(B) is all powered displays. My research shows those are a maintenance nightmare. I'd avoid (B).,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,(A) has local craftspeople! That means lower transport costs and maybe less lab work since they are practicing artists.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Victoria,,(A) also fits our volunteer roster perfectly. The town history circle would love local weaving.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shion,,(A) has demonstration sessions. That satisfies the visitor desire to see people working.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Asuka,,(A) is likely lightweight and wouldn't interfere with evening hire bookings. It's the safest choice for the building.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shizue,,And local loans mean less risk of shipping cut-off disasters. (A) seems very reliable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm voting for (A)! It's budget-friendly and cheerful.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It's the most sustainable choice for our current staffing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I'm torn, but (A) hits the engagement marks without the risk of (B).","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Asuka,,(A) is the only one that doesn't threaten the structural or scheduling limits.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel very comfortable with (A). It's a gentle, manageable plan.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
